  "prefLabel": "Plu 308.07 Late Fees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plu 308.07 Late Fees. The board shall charge a late fee of $25.00 per month or part of a month when it receives an application for renewal of a license or certification after the expiration date of the license or certification and before the one-year anniversary of the expiration date.\n\nSource. #8916, eff 6-22-07",
